---
title: "C25 — Independent release decision · Implemented"
---
flowchart TD
  App[For each API, web and worker app] --> Baseline[Read its latest published release]
  Baseline --> Previous{Previous published release exists?}
  Previous -->|No| First[Initialize version 0.1.0]
  First --> Version[Independent app version]
  Previous -->|Yes| Fingerprint[Compare committed runtime and build-input fingerprints]
  Fingerprint --> Changed{Final artifact inputs changed?}
  Changed -->|No| Skip[No new tag, image or release]
  Changed -->|Yes| Commits[Inspect relevant shipped commits]
  Commits --> Bump[Highest relevant major, minor or patch bump]
  Bump --> Version
  Version --> Publish[Build and publish that app]
  Shared[Shared runtime package changes affect consumers] -. dependency graph .-> Fingerprint
  Docs[Docs, tests and lint-only changes excluded] -. input policy .-> Fingerprint
